WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:10.360
Que tengas una buena noche.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:12.040
Yeah. We'll see you around. Kristina.

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:15.520
I have no idea how soon

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:17.280
we’ll be seeing each other.

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:22.880
You’ve been gone for a while.

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:24.400
I was

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:26.960
giving you a chance to catch up with

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:27.960
Christina.

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:31.920
You're not planning

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:34.680
on playing the jealousy card, are you?

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.280
Don't count on it.

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:42.680
Okay.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:43.720
Even though you don't care,

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:45.920
but I will say this.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:48.240
Christina is in the past.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:50.520
and there are more interesting

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:52.280
women than her.

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:54.520
Let’s just

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:55.720
watch the ceremony.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:01.160
We've reached the highlights

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:02.440
of this evening.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:07.920
The award

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:10.920
for the best hotel chain of the year.

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:12.400
No need for a photo finish

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:14.480
to see who crossed the line this year

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:15.560
first.

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:18.760
Aspen Corp, ladies and gentlemen!
